_nc_oc=AdrD_306S0W0juhc8qQ-c-iwyYeyKBkPBSo7Cd10sVU58sDtjGsTaUBRzVIXQtGd4Po&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTeFeMqfDx4AEuiP4hTbiW43KAedU40ZA1nD225e85IFw&oe=6B072170"}, {"file_name": "03.png", "id": "819071991221979", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620965_819071994555312_4872624989676096735_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_rEyJfLtDIMQ7kNvwHIqgAh&_nc_oc=AdoWqE4ZhFIh36XXU6czFl46MiRXHjSRapQn1aGvNim6gMk5Ny12gFCXpR-zPwGAvMw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQoMTulJcXklNSjEF_nM2RkEb3nocjqs62BUq5rE4eCRw&oe=6B0723C7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1393147342809311", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499628893_1393147346142644_4835142897793746956_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PuMobGqyjIcQ7kNvwFfVUVl&_nc_oc=Adru-4d6oUfe7V2KMZm2IuqnRTfmx1uzMML-IaM4zSux49BGztljDxg2pCLEWqJQlbU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQN2AdOFpi0byj0xL_iBo5uaEMnPdrvv__i052ZKvPRJg&oe=6B0701FF"}, "display_name": "Fit Beat Combat : Boxing Fitness Workout", "keywords": ["Cardio", "Exercise", "Dance", "Music", "MR"], "long_description": "# \ud83c\udfcfLatest Update: Swing Flow\uff01\nSwing your bat and hit the notes! Power up your workout with Swing Flow!                                                                                                 \n{1819748662242426}\n\n# \ud83e\uddb5 Power Up with Knee Strike!\nTake your workout to the next level with the powerful Knee Strike move!\n{1438345965070088}\n\n# \u26a1 Instant Fitness, Instant Fun \ud83c\udfb5\n{1602260954447685}\n\nPut on your headset and start punching in seconds. No setup, waiting, or complicated menus. Just instant cardio that gets your heart pumping and your body moving.\n\n# \ud83c\udfdf\ufe0f Your Private Ring, Your Rules.\n{933141996220885}\nIn your own virtual arena, you set the pace. Punch and dodge to heart-pumping music without pressure or judgment.\n\n# \ud83d\udcaa Fitness That Feels Good.\nForget the pressure. Enjoy moving your body and reaching your goals\u2014stress relief, improved stamina, or weight loss\u2014from the comfort and privacy of home.\n\n# \ud83c\udfb6 Your Personal Soundtrack to Success.\nExercising is more fun when it\u2019s set to your personal playlist. Choose from a wide variety of songs and throw punches to the rhythm. Discover new favorites and build the perfect soundtrack for your fitness.\n\n# \ud83d\udd25 Key Features:\n- \u26a1 Instant Action: Put on headset, start punching in seconds\n- \ud83d\udcaa Full-Body Cardio: Engage your arms, core, and legs for maximum results\n- \ud83c\udfb5 Uplifting Soundtrack: Music that makes you want to move\n- \ud83c\udfe0 Mixed Reality (MR) Fitness: Bring the workout game into your real world.\n\n# Start Your Workout Now.", "short_description": "Fit Beat Combat! Get fit having fun with music & coaching! Thrilling full-body workout. Quit boring exercises & achieve your ideal body!\u3000"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1475547314718767", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Fit Beat Combat : Boxing Fitness Workout", "keywords": ["Cardio", "Exercise", "Dance", "Music", "MR"], "long_description": "# \ud83c\udfcfDerni\u00e8re mise \u00e0 jour : Swing Flow !\nFrappez les notes avec votre batte ! Boostez vos s\u00e9ances avec Swing Flow !                                                                                          \n{4079084705730418}\n\n# \ud83e\uddb5 Faites le plein d'\u00e9nergie avec Knee Strike !\nBoostez vos s\u00e9ances avec le puissant Knee Strike !\n{1419934616788128}\n\n# \u26a1 Fitness imm\u00e9diat, plaisir instantan\u00e9 \ud83c\udfb5\n{2010962616244831}\nEnfilez le casque et frappez en quelques secondes. Sans pr\u00e9paration, attente ni menus compliqu\u00e9s. Du cardio qui stimule le c\u0153ur et fait bouger le corps.\n\n# \ud83c\udfdf\ufe0f Votre ring, vos r\u00e8gles.\n{1440133471631795}\nDans votre ar\u00e8ne virtuelle, fixez votre rythme. Frappez et esquivez sur une musique entra\u00eenante, sans pression ni jugement.\n\n# \ud83d\udcaa Le fitness qui fait du bien.\nBougez avec plaisir et atteignez vos objectifs : moins de stress, plus d'endurance ou perte de poids, dans le confort et l'intimit\u00e9 de votre foyer.\n\n# \ud83c\udfb6 Votre bande-son pour r\u00e9ussir.\nVotre playlist rend l'exercice plus amusant. Choisissez parmi de nombreux titres et frappez en rythme. Trouvez de nouveaux favoris pour cr\u00e9er votre bande-son fitness id\u00e9ale.\n\n# \ud83d\udd25 Atouts :\n- \u26a1 Action imm\u00e9diate : enfilez le casque et frappez en quelques secondes\n- \ud83d\udcaa Cardio complet : sollicitez bras, tronc et jambes pour un maximum de r\u00e9sultats\n- \ud83c\udfb5 Musique entra\u00eenante : des titres qui donnent envie de bouger\n- \ud83c\udfe0 Fitness en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 mixte (MR) : le jeu s'invite dans votre espace r\u00e9el.\n\n# Commencez votre s\u00e9ance !", "short_description": "Fit Beat Combat! Get fit having fun with music & coaching! Thrilling full-body workout. Quit boring exercises & achieve your ideal body!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1450480956613019", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Fit Beat Combat : Boxing Fitness Workout", "keywords": ["Cardio", "Exercise", "Dance", "Music", "MR"], "long_description": "# \ud83c\udfcf\u00daltima actualizaci\u00f3n: \u00a1Swing Flow!\n\u00a1Batea las notas! \u00a1Dale m\u00e1s energ\u00eda a tu entrenamiento con Swing Flow!                                                                                                  \n{1479379370810109}\n\n# \ud83e\uddb5 \u00a1M\u00e1s energ\u00eda con Knee Strike!\n\u00a1Lleva tu entrenamiento al siguiente nivel con el potente movimiento Knee Strike!\n{2338769150246482}\n\n# \u26a1 Fitness al instante, diversi\u00f3n inmediata \ud83c\udfb5\n{2630171710742308}\n\nPonte el visor y empieza a golpear en segundos. Sin preparativos, esperas ni men\u00fas complicados. Cardio al instante que acelera tu coraz\u00f3n y pone tu cuerpo en movimiento.\n\n# \ud83c\udfdf\ufe0f Tu ring, tus reglas.\n{1135537286074100}\nEn tu arena virtual, t\u00fa marcas el ritmo. Golpea y esquiva con m\u00fasica vibrante, sin presi\u00f3n ni juicios.\n\n# \ud83d\udcaa Fitness para sentirte bien.\nDisfruta movi\u00e9ndote y alcanza tus metas: aliviar el estr\u00e9s, mejorar tu resistencia o perder peso, con la comodidad y privacidad de tu hogar.\n\n# \ud83c\udfb6 Tu banda sonora hacia el \u00e9xito.\nEntrenar es m\u00e1s divertido con tu playlist. Elige entre muchas canciones y golpea al ritmo. Descubre nuevos favoritos y crea tu banda sonora ideal para entrenar.\n\n# \ud83d\udd25 Caracter\u00edsticas:\n- \u26a1 Acci\u00f3n inmediata: ponte el visor y golpea en segundos\n- \ud83d\udcaa Cardio de cuerpo completo: trabaja brazos, tronco y piernas para maximizar resultados\n- \ud83c\udfb5 M\u00fasica motivadora: canciones que te invitan a moverte\n- \ud83c\udfe0 Fitness en realidad mixta (MR): lleva el juego de entrenamiento a tu mundo real.\n\n# \u00a1Empieza a entrenar ahora!", "short_description": "Fit Beat Combat! Get fit having fun with music & coaching! Thrilling full-body workout. Quit boring exercises & achieve your ideal body!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "New Story Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/product/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}], 